#: includes/integrations/mcp-integration.php:190
msgid ""
"How many order requests customers sent to the store's WhatsApp in a date "
"range, compared with the period before: requests, how many were whole carts "
"vs single products, units and the value of the requested items at the "
"prices of the moment, plus a per-day list. A request is counted when the "
