"1. order-via-chat-requests-report with after and before set to those days.\n"
"2. order-via-chat-top-products with limit 10.\n"
"3. order-via-chat-get-settings for the setup and its checklist.\n"
"4. order-via-chat-check-product for any top product whose can_order is "
"false.\n"
"\n"
"Then write a short review for the store owner:\n"
"- Requests, cart vs single product requests and requested value, with the "
"change against the previous period in percent (say \"new\" when the "
"previous period had none).\n"
"- The busiest days, and the products people ask for most.\n"
"- Popular products that can no longer be ordered on WhatsApp, and why.\n"
"- Setup gaps from the checklist and settings (no number, button not placed, "
"ordering off).\n"
"- Up to three next steps.\n"
"Remember a request is a lead (WhatsApp opened with the order), not a paid "
"order. Use the store currency, round money to 2 decimals and keep it under "
"250 words. Say plainly when there were no requests."
msgstr ""

